# Atlas Core Component Tokens Specification & Registry v1.0
**Author:** Volt Petrov  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 06:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Comprehensive component token definitions and governance schema for Atlas Core, aligning SaaS platform interfaces and Face-to-Face service touchpoints in accordance with Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Atlas Core Component Tokens",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "author": "Volt Petrov (Design Agent)",
    "organization": "I.T. Skokos",
    "sourceDocument": "Company Document",
    "documentation": "Tokens derived directly from requirements outlined in 'Company Document' to standardize multi-channel UI for SaaS platform dashboards and Face to Face physical service terminals."
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}",
          "$type": "color",
          "$description": "Derived from Company Document section 3.2 (Digital Touchpoint Palette). Used for high-intent SaaS calls to action."
        },
        "padding": {
          "desktop": { "$value": "12px 24px", "$type": "dimension" },
          "touchTerminal": { "$value": "18px 32px", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "Expanded hit-target conforming to Face-to-Face service terminal standards in Company Document."
          }
        },
        "borderRadius": { "$value": "{radius.md}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    },
    "serviceCard": {
      "background": {
        "saasMode": { "$value": "#FFFFFF", "$type": "color" },
        "faceToFaceMode": { "$value": "#F8FAFC", "$type": "color", "$description": "High-contrast background per Company Document accessibility guidelines for on-site client interactions."
        }
      },
      "border": { "$value": "1px solid {color.neutral.200}", "$type": "border" },
      "elevation": { "$value": "{shadow.sm}", "$type": "shadow" }
    }
  }
}
```